SUMMARY: SLNA-WRG REmarket #17 Day 2
DESCRIPTION:The SLNA Waste Reduction Group is holding its 17th REmarket\,
  a two-day event for the collection of unwanted items and repairs\n\n10 a
 m - 6 pm Donations and Recycling Drop Offs\n\n11 am - 3 pm* Repair Cafe T
 oronto & CultureLink Bike Hub\n\nRepair Café Toronto will be fixing cloth
 ing\, jewellery\, computers\, home electronics\, small appliances\, house
 wares\,\n\nand toys\, while CultureLink Bike Hub will be doing small bike
  repairs and safety checks.\n\n*Registration ends at 2 pm\; limit of 1 it
 em per person.\n\nFor full event details\, go to REmarket Guidelines http
 s://www.slna.ca/remarket-guidelines.html .\n\nPlease email reduce@slna.ca
  mailto:reduce@slna.ca with any questions.
