SUMMARY: November 1 & 2: All Saints' and All Souls' - In remembrance of o
 ur loved ones and all the faithful departed
DESCRIPTION:November 1 at 8:00am\, 9:00am & 11:00am • All Saints’ Day\nJo
 in us for our morning services as we celebrate All Saints’ Day. All are w
 armly welcome!\n\nNovember 1 at 4:30pm • Requiem by Gabriel Fauré sung by
  Candlelight\nJoin us for Choral Vespers on the Eve of All Souls’ Day as 
 we remember our loved ones and all the faithful departed through Gabriel 
 Fauré’s Requiem\, sung by the Cathedral Choir with orchestral accompanime
 nt.\n\nNovember 2 • All Souls’ Day at St. James Cemetery & Cathedral\nHol
 y Eucharist at 11:00am (St. James Cemetery- 635 Parliament St\, Toronto O
 N M4X 1R1)\nHoly Eucharist at 12:15pm (St. James Cathedral) in remembranc
 e of our loved ones and all the faithful departed.
