SUMMARY: Cooking for the Community at Fort York Food Bank
DESCRIPTION:Volunteer to help us cook and prepare meals for those that ne
 ed it.\n\nJoin Rotary Toronto Sunrise as we prepare and serve delicious m
 eals for the community at Fort York Food Bank!\n\nYou can choose to volun
 teer with the First Crew from 9am -11am where we will be prepping ingredi
 ents and doing most of the cooking or if you like to sleep in you can joi
 n our Second Crew from 11am - 1 pm which is wrapping up the cooking\, ser
 ving the meal and cleaning up. Sign up on Eventbrite here https://www.eve
 ntbrite.ca/e/cooking-for-the-community-at-fort-york-food-bank-tickets-200
 3694734890?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true .\n\nDon't know how to cook or
  clean? Don't worry\, we'll teach you how.
