SUMMARY: November 8: Remembrance Sunday Services - St. James Cathedral
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, November 8 • Remembrance Sunday Services – St. James
  Cathedral\n\n10:15am: Remembrance observance at the Memorial Cross.\n\n1
 1:00am: Choral Eucharist Service & Parade\, joined by the Royal Regiment 
 of Canada members.\n\n1:00pm: The Governor General’s Horse Guards’ Rememb
 rance Day Service.\n\nTogether\, let us honour those who have served and 
 sacrificed for peace\, remember the fallen\, and reflect on the importanc
 e of carrying forward a legacy of gratitude\, hope\, and peace.\n\nDetail
 s: stjamescathedral.ca/remembrance https://stjamescathedral.ca/remembranc
 e/
