DESCRIPTION:We are excited to announce that the renowned theologian\, tea
 cher\, speaker\, and musician Jeremy Begbie will lead a series of inspiri
 ng events in November at St. James Cathedral Centre and Trinity College.\
 n\nThis event is brought to you by Thomas Bell\, Director of Music\, in c
 onjunction with the Faculty of Divinity at Trinity College through the Re
 imagining Contemporary Ministries Initiative.\n\nTuesday\, November 17\, 
 2026 – 7:30pm\nPublic Lecture: Why should the arts matter to people of fa
 ith?\nLocation: St. James Cathedral Centre – 65 Church St\, Toronto\, ON 
 M5C 2E9\n\nLearn more and register here http://www.trinity.utoronto.ca/ev
 ent/jeremy-begbie-workshop-and-lecture-series-2026
