SUMMARY: Santa Claus Parade
DESCRIPTION:Starting at Christie Pitts and travelling along Bloor and dow
 n Yonge Sts.\, Toronto's original Santa Claus Parade continues its 122 ye
 ar tradition in 2026. It finishes at the St. Lawrence Market.\n\nWatch fr
 om the streets or from the comfort of home. The organizers are thrilled t
 o share that this year\, the parade is back on TV on Citytv and streaming
  on Citytv+\, bringing the magic of the parade straight into your living 
 room.\n\nHuge thanks to the amazing 2026 sponsors\, volunteers\, staff\, 
 and entire community — without you\, this celebration wouldn’t be possibl
 e. Let’s make this year’s parade the most joyful yet!
